From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: iAmMichaelConnor <mike@aztec.foundation>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 21:50:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat!: bump the contract address domain separator to v3

Rename DOM_SEP__CONTRACT_ADDRESS_V2 to DOM_SEP__CONTRACT_ADDRESS_V3 (993442748, hash_to_u32("az_dom_sep", "contract_address_v3")) so v6 contract addresses cannot collide with v5 ones, and refresh the address test vectors, the noir_test_gen snapshot and the standard-contract address tables that derive from it.

